  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods and Food Security Trust Fund for the rural poor and vulnerable in Burma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Livelihoods and Food Security Trust Fund for the rural poor and vulnerable in Burma is a component of Livelihoods and Food Security Trust Fund for Burma (NUTSEM) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;2,000,000. It works in the following sector(s): Agricultural development, Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries, Environmental policy and administrative management, Social Protection, Basic drinking water supply, Basic sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
